[{:doc/type :team-assignments
  :doc/id "month-3-team-assignments"
  :doc/title "Month 3 Canary Execution — Team Assignments & On-Call Rotation (2026-09-11 to 2026-09-14)"
  :doc/date "2026-07-21"
  :doc/author "Claude Code Agent"
  :doc/status "ACTIVE"

  :team/overview
  "Month 3 canary execution (2026-09-11 to 2026-09-14) requires 24/7 on-call coverage with specialized roles.
   This document assigns roles, defines escalation paths, and schedules on-call rotation.
   All team members must complete runbook review and fire-drill testing by 2026-09-08 (pre-flight gate)."

